# Environment variables for utah-water-rights-mcp
#
# This project currently has NO required env vars or secrets — it only
# reads public, unauthenticated endpoints on waterrights.utah.gov. This
# file is a template so future contributors know where to add things
# when that changes.
#
# How env actually wires into a Cloudflare Worker (not via .env):
#   Production secrets → `wrangler secret put <NAME>`
#   Production vars     → `vars:` block in wrangler.jsonc
#   Local-dev secrets   → `.dev.vars` (gitignored; same key=value syntax as below)
#
# Copy this file to `.env` for any tooling that reads dotenv files, or
# to `.dev.vars` for use with `wrangler dev`. Add each new variable to
# the `Env` interface (regenerated via `npm run cf-typegen` after you
# declare it in wrangler.jsonc).

# Example — uncomment and rename when a secret is actually needed:
# DWR_API_KEY=
